            "detailed_description": "By the same studio of The Bluecoats: North vs South<br><br>The pirates have embarked on a treasure hunt, and the corsairs have embarked on a pirate hunt. Things won't end well! Davy Jones' gold surfaces on its own, throwing the pirate-infested waters into turmoil. Capture, pillage, rob and crush your opponents in this naval strategy game. <br>Play alone or with multiple players. All aboard!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A large marine map. <br></li><li>A strategic war game. <br></li><li>Action phases to resolve combats. <br></li><li>Local multiplayer or pass-n-play. </li></ul>",
